From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 20:39:42 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] UI-OPTIONS: docs, status, ledger row, speed2 options
 group, Spanish help fits one line

docs/GBA.md section and EWRAM ledger row, docs/PS1.md and docs/DREAMCAST.md notes, ROADMAP Done line, UI status,
OWNER_DECISIONS defaults (nine tabs), UI_PLAN 4.1 as built, gba speed2_options.txt (every page, the card, a
preview row) and the life group's Options windows on the new pages. The language row's Spanish help keeps the
word idioma (lang_es.txt).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Xd63czLgdbSn871LSJKjVC
